{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28583","headline":"郡斋秋夜即事寄斛斯处士许秀才 · 杜牧","name":"郡斋秋夜即事寄斛斯处士许秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有客谁人肯夜过，独怜风景奈愁何。\n边鸿怨处迷霜久，庭树空来见月多。\n故国杳无千里信，彩弦时伴一声歌。\n驰心秖待城乌晓，几对虚檐望白河。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}